 waiting to move, choose your next release, and watch the belt carry them through the puzzle. The next color matters, but so does the sequence you create.\n\n# A LITTLE WORLD OF COLOR\n\nSee the conveyor and bottle groups laid out in front of you. Follow your choices around the board as a busy arrangement becomes a completed puzzle.\n- Whole-bottle color sorting\n- Moving conveyor puzzles\n- Move planning and sequencing\n- Miniature 3D tabletop presentation \n\nFor players who enjoy color matching, sorting games, and figuring out what should move next.\n\nChoose your first bottle and put your plan in motion.", "short_description": "Choose which bottles ride the conveyor, match their colors, and solve a miniature tabletop puzzle in VR. One clever sequence can clear the board."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://engaginggamesstudio.com/privacy_zap.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Games Zap", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://engaginggamesstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1407913389073275"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1158604629969386"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1063622330034927"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1063622330034927"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes":